Master Set List (MSL) v3.13 — 140 Node Master Gold Set
=====================================================

Project Initialization Date: May 23, 2026

PROJECT PURPOSE
---------------
The Master Set List (MSL) was developed as a high-quality, technically 
rigorous audiophile test suite for evaluating stereo hardware performance.

Core Goals:
- Provide repeatable, diagnostic-grade tracks for testing specific 
  aspects of audio reproduction.
- Balance technical utility with musical enjoyment.
- Maintain a clean, version-controlled, and well-documented collection.
- Serve as a consistent benchmark across different listening sessions 
  and hardware configurations.

HARDWARE CONFIGURATIONS
-----------------------
Two primary systems are used for evaluation:

- Main Stereo System:     Rotel RA-1572 MKII → Sonus Faber Cremona (primary)
- Tesla Model 3 Highland: High-resolution FLAC via Roon + Qobuz (secondary)

